WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.500
(pensive music)
(ball spinning)

00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:04.430
- [Katherine] This may look
like a typical casino floor

00:00:04.430 --> 00:00:06.000
but there's no gamblers,

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:09.083
no chips changing hands or free drinks.

00:00:10.020 --> 00:00:13.050
That's because this is live dealing,

00:00:13.050 --> 00:00:15.770
a type of online gambling new to the US

00:00:15.770 --> 00:00:19.291
in which games are broadcast
to players' phones.

00:00:19.291 --> 00:00:20.910
(lion roaring)

00:00:20.910 --> 00:00:23.440
- Boom, that's what I'm talking about.

00:00:23.440 --> 00:00:25.180
- [Katherine] No matter
where you look today,

00:00:25.180 --> 00:00:27.280
you've likely encountered these:

00:00:27.280 --> 00:00:29.250
ads for online gambling.

00:00:29.250 --> 00:00:30.083
- I put a million bucks

00:00:30.083 --> 00:00:32.540
in up to five DraftKings
sportsbook accounts.

00:00:32.540 --> 00:00:33.770
- None of these commercials

00:00:33.770 --> 00:00:34.930
would have been possible

00:00:34.930 --> 00:00:38.010
without a 2018 Supreme Court decision

00:00:38.010 --> 00:00:40.970
that struck down the
federal sports gambling ban

00:00:40.970 --> 00:00:43.510
and triggered an accelerated adoption

00:00:43.510 --> 00:00:46.710
of online gambling across the US.

00:00:46.710 --> 00:00:50.260
Today, six states,
mostly in the northeast,

00:00:50.260 --> 00:00:53.200
allow for online casino
games like blackjack,

00:00:53.200 --> 00:00:55.240
roulette and baccarat.

00:00:55.240 --> 00:00:58.785
One of the new entrants
into the market is Playtech.

00:00:58.785 --> 00:01:00.450
(card beeping)
(door clicking)

00:01:00.450 --> 00:01:03.820
So the security in this
building seems pretty high.

00:01:03.820 --> 00:01:04.850
Why is that?

00:01:04.850 --> 00:01:05.810
- Yeah.

00:01:05.810 --> 00:01:08.320
Security is the first priority here.

00:01:08.320 --> 00:01:11.010
- I sat down with
Playtech's managing director

00:01:11.010 --> 00:01:13.260
for Live Casino, Edo Haitin.

00:01:13.260 --> 00:01:15.800
So we're sitting here
in an office building

00:01:15.800 --> 00:01:17.350
in Southfield, Michigan

00:01:17.350 --> 00:01:19.800
but all around us it looks like a casino.

00:01:19.800 --> 00:01:22.370
So where are we right now?

00:01:22.370 --> 00:01:24.570
- So we are in Michigan.

00:01:24.570 --> 00:01:26.370
We cannot say the actual address.

00:01:26.370 --> 00:01:27.930
This is one of our studios.

00:01:27.930 --> 00:01:29.810
It looks like a casino but it's not.

00:01:29.810 --> 00:01:32.490
There is no gambling
activities happening here

00:01:32.490 --> 00:01:33.440
within the facility.

00:01:33.440 --> 00:01:35.240
Here basically, we operate the games,

00:01:35.240 --> 00:01:36.510
we train the dealers

00:01:36.510 --> 00:01:39.503
and make the whole full-blown product.

00:01:40.490 --> 00:01:43.180
- Playtech is a gambling
technology company

00:01:43.180 --> 00:01:46.860
that offers live dealing
where dealers flip cards

00:01:46.860 --> 00:01:49.140
and spin roulette wheels
in front of cameras

00:01:49.140 --> 00:01:51.340
for gamblers at home on their phones.

00:01:51.340 --> 00:01:52.670
So if I'm in Michigan,

00:01:52.670 --> 00:01:55.190
I can open an app and bet on one

00:01:55.190 --> 00:01:56.824
of the games happening here.

00:01:56.824 --> 00:01:57.750
- Correct, correct.

00:01:57.750 --> 00:01:58.583
Not far away from us,

00:01:58.583 --> 00:02:00.570
there are live games being operated now.

00:02:00.570 --> 00:02:02.790
- Why develop a whole live studio?

00:02:02.790 --> 00:02:05.450
Why not just have animated games on an app

00:02:05.450 --> 00:02:07.010
that someone can gamble on?

00:02:07.010 --> 00:02:09.070
- Around 13, 14 years ago already,

00:02:09.070 --> 00:02:11.160
we started to establish sort of a side gig

00:02:11.160 --> 00:02:12.440
to our regular casino games,

00:02:12.440 --> 00:02:15.180
which were live casino games streamed.

00:02:15.180 --> 00:02:16.107
People could sit at the table

00:02:16.107 --> 00:02:18.120
and also bet with a live dealer.

00:02:18.120 --> 00:02:20.570
- You're one step closer
to that 1,000 golden pool.

00:02:20.570 --> 00:02:21.860
Okay, here we go.

00:02:21.860 --> 00:02:24.540
- Then the players started
piling up more and more

00:02:24.540 --> 00:02:25.440
into those tables

00:02:25.440 --> 00:02:26.940
because the experience that you give

00:02:26.940 --> 00:02:28.750
is as close as you can get

00:02:28.750 --> 00:02:31.340
to a land-based casino experience.

00:02:31.340 --> 00:02:34.630
Also, it takes away that
sort of loneliness element

00:02:34.630 --> 00:02:36.674
when you sit at your home and bet alone.

00:02:36.674 --> 00:02:37.750
(ball spinning)

00:02:37.750 --> 00:02:39.640
- [Katherine] Although
Playtech is a big player

00:02:39.640 --> 00:02:40.770
in online gambling,

00:02:40.770 --> 00:02:43.810
gamblers themselves might
not necessarily be familiar

00:02:43.810 --> 00:02:44.643
with the name.

00:02:45.520 --> 00:02:48.360
That's because a big part
of Playtech's business

00:02:48.360 --> 00:02:51.120
is providing various
online gaming products

00:02:51.120 --> 00:02:54.460
to a variety of licensed
companies around the world.

00:02:54.460 --> 00:02:56.290
- Welcome to our Sports Bar studio.

00:02:56.290 --> 00:03:00.420
Our Sports Bar strategy
is basically bringing some

00:03:00.420 --> 00:03:01.770
of the sportsbook players,

00:03:01.770 --> 00:03:04.230
some of the sports fans and allowing them

00:03:04.230 --> 00:03:06.050
to interact with sports events

00:03:06.050 --> 00:03:08.400
while they also play our games.

00:03:08.400 --> 00:03:10.520
So here you can see cash-back blackjack.

00:03:10.520 --> 00:03:13.200
That's a scalable version
of a blackjack table

00:03:13.200 --> 00:03:15.090
that allows unlimited about of players

00:03:15.090 --> 00:03:18.230
to sit at the same
table playing blackjack.

00:03:18.230 --> 00:03:19.930
This is part of our training module

00:03:19.930 --> 00:03:21.950
to eventually get our presenters,

00:03:21.950 --> 00:03:23.840
our dealers when they go live

00:03:23.840 --> 00:03:24.820
with a certain experience

00:03:24.820 --> 00:03:27.920
to really know what is the script

00:03:27.920 --> 00:03:29.370
without having a script.

00:03:29.370 --> 00:03:30.820
- And gamblers online,

00:03:30.820 --> 00:03:33.210
they actually can create a relationship.

00:03:33.210 --> 00:03:34.860
- Yeah, that's the community aspect

00:03:34.860 --> 00:03:37.403
that is making live unique.

00:03:38.330 --> 00:03:39.700
- Online casino betting

00:03:39.700 --> 00:03:42.800
is a small but growing industry in the US

00:03:42.800 --> 00:03:44.500
that many gambling companies hope

00:03:44.500 --> 00:03:46.910
will become increasingly legalized

00:03:46.910 --> 00:03:49.390
in much the same way mobile sports betting

00:03:49.390 --> 00:03:51.960
already has been in many states.

00:03:51.960 --> 00:03:54.950
In the US, the biggest
online casino market

00:03:54.950 --> 00:03:56.350
is in New Jersey.

00:03:56.350 --> 00:03:59.360
This graph charts the steady
increase in revenue seen

00:03:59.360 --> 00:04:02.530
by the Garden State since 2017.

00:04:02.530 --> 00:04:04.550
I see a big red button.

00:04:04.550 --> 00:04:05.670
What's going on here?

00:04:05.670 --> 00:04:07.800
This is Buffalo Blitz Live.

00:04:07.800 --> 00:04:09.820
Buffalo Blitz is a slot concept

00:04:09.820 --> 00:04:11.280
that allows multiple players

00:04:11.280 --> 00:04:13.380
to sit and play on the same slot

00:04:13.380 --> 00:04:15.650
and allows you to
interact with the dealer,

00:04:15.650 --> 00:04:17.960
allows you to interact with
other players on the chat.

00:04:17.960 --> 00:04:20.330
- Although the expansion of legal gambling

00:04:20.330 --> 00:04:23.270
generates significant
tax revenue for states,

00:04:23.270 --> 00:04:25.580
problem gambling advocates are concerned

00:04:25.580 --> 00:04:27.950
about a potential rise in addiction.

00:04:27.950 --> 00:04:32.280
So when you talk about
24/7 availability at home,

00:04:32.280 --> 00:04:34.430
how do you address gambling addiction?

00:04:34.430 --> 00:04:36.530
- Already the websites that we work with,

00:04:36.530 --> 00:04:41.520
they are also complying with regulations

00:04:41.520 --> 00:04:43.500
that apply to them

00:04:43.500 --> 00:04:46.430
and a player cannot bet more than he can,

00:04:46.430 --> 00:04:48.860
and cannot deposit more that he's allowed.

00:04:48.860 --> 00:04:50.520
We have functions that's called hosts,

00:04:50.520 --> 00:04:52.920
gaming hosts, people that
are actually on the floor,

00:04:52.920 --> 00:04:54.330
not dealing the tables

00:04:54.330 --> 00:04:57.380
and if we see if somebody's
betting over his abilities,

00:04:57.380 --> 00:05:00.930
we have a way that our system
can flag those players.

00:05:00.930 --> 00:05:04.750
This is far away from being
a hit-and-run operation.

00:05:04.750 --> 00:05:08.070
- Casinos in Las Vegas and
around the world shut down

00:05:08.070 --> 00:05:09.870
when the pandemic began,

00:05:09.870 --> 00:05:12.590
leaving gamblers searching
for options at home.

00:05:12.590 --> 00:05:15.093
In recent months,
tourists have flocked back

00:05:15.093 --> 00:05:17.410
but casino operators acknowledge

00:05:17.410 --> 00:05:19.500
that online betting is here to stay.

00:05:19.500 --> 00:05:23.210
So does that mean casinos
in real life are going away?

00:05:23.210 --> 00:05:24.180
- Absolutely not.

00:05:24.180 --> 00:05:27.900
First of all, we are their
extension to the online,

00:05:27.900 --> 00:05:30.250
so a lot of our licensees,
clients basically

00:05:30.250 --> 00:05:31.820
are land-based casinos

00:05:31.820 --> 00:05:33.090
that want to extent their business

00:05:33.090 --> 00:05:34.350
and move to the online.

00:05:34.350 --> 00:05:36.530
And no matter how great the experience

00:05:36.530 --> 00:05:37.730
that we wanna give here,

00:05:37.730 --> 00:05:39.800
it's still an online experience.

00:05:39.800 --> 00:05:43.610
I think that the land-based experience

00:05:43.610 --> 00:05:45.709
gives a completely different value.

00:05:45.709 --> 00:05:46.620
(ball spinning)

00:05:46.620 --> 00:05:48.880
- [Katherine] The arrival
of live dealing in the US

00:05:48.880 --> 00:05:52.070
comes amid transformation
for the gambling industry.

00:05:52.070 --> 00:05:54.390
In recent years, more and more states

00:05:54.390 --> 00:05:56.310
are embracing new forms of betting

00:05:56.310 --> 00:05:58.700
as a lucrative source of tax revenue.

00:05:58.700 --> 00:06:01.090
But with the recent surge in gambling ads

00:06:01.090 --> 00:06:04.800
and the 24/7 availability
of wagering at home,

00:06:04.800 --> 00:06:07.890
questions remain about the
long-term impact on Americans.

00:06:07.890 --> 00:06:10.557
(pensive music)

